            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0541">3-05-005-0541</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ERRONEOUS ADVICE OR MISLEADING STATEMENTS BY THE TAX COLLECTOR; ABATEMENT OF PENALTIES AND INTEREST; DEFINITION</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0542">3-05-005-0542</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PROSPECTIVE APPLICATION OF NEW LAW OR INTERPRETATION OR APPLICATION OF LAW</p>

