            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0546">3-05-005-0546</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CLOSING AGREEMENTS IN CASES OF EXTENSIVE TAXPAYER MISUNDERSTANDING OR MISAPPLICATION; APPROVAL; RULES</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0550">3-05-005-0550</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;LIMITATION PERIODS</p>

