            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0555">3-05-005-0555</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;TAX COLLECTOR MAY EXAMINE BOOKS AND OTHER RECORDS; FAILURE TO PROVIDE RECORDS</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0556">3-05-005-0556</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;NO ADDITIONAL AUDITS OR PROPOSED ASSESSMENTS; EXCEPTIONS</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0560">3-05-005-0560</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ERRONEOUS PAYMENT OF TAX; CREDITS AND REFUNDS; LIMITATIONS</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0565">3-05-005-0565</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PAYMENT OF TAX BY THE INCORRECT TAXPAYER OR TO THE INCORRECT ARIZONA CITY OR TOWN</p>

