            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0572">3-05-005-0572</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;EXPEDITED REVIEW OF JEOPARDY ASSESSMENTS</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0575">3-05-005-0575</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;JUDICIAL REVIEW</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0577">3-05-005-0577</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;REFUNDS OF TAXES PAID UNDER PROTEST</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff03/Flagstaff0305005.html#3.05.005.0578">3-05-005-0578</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;REIMBURSEMENT OF FEES AND OTHER COSTS; DEFINITIONS</p>

